  "identity": "Anchored silence guardian, broad stooped charcoal-purple stone body under a thick pale grey muffling stole. Smooth CLOSED faceless ivory visor with only a thin sealed horizontal seam, no eyes or mouth drawn. Two massive padded stone mitts held near chest and squat pedestal base. Dark violet inset panels, no bell, no text or glyphs. Extremely self-important hush-keeper with gently comic hunch.",
